(SECTION 3: STARTING SYSTEM & 12V BATTERY TESTING) '
() '
(Starting Symptom: Clicking Noise / No Engine Crank) '
(- If starter solenoid clicks rapidly, 12V battery terminal voltage is below 10.0V.) '
(- Clean corroded battery posts with sodium bicarbonate solution and wire brush.) '
(- Parasitic Draw Inspection: Standard quiescent current must be under 35mA after) '
(  security system arms and BCM enters sleep mode \(allow 20 minutes\).) '
(- Starter Relay Check: Swap starter cut relay with horn relay in engine under-hood box.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
