(SECTION 4: BRAKE SYSTEM WEAR LIMITS & INSPECTION) '
() '
(Brake Pad Thickness Specification:) '
(- Front Brake Pad Standard Thickness: 9.5 mm to 10.5 mm.) '
(- Service Wear Limit: 1.6 mm \(replace pads immediately if below 2.0 mm\).) '
(- Brake Rotor Thickness Standard: 25.0 mm. Minimum Refinish Limit: 23.0 mm.) '
(- Brake Squeak / Squeal Cause: Wear indicators contact rotor when pad thickness) '
(  drops below 2.5 mm. Replace front pad set and lubricate caliper sliding pins.) '
ET
endstream
